{key:A}
{sop:Verse 1}
[F#m]Se oye un son en a[A]lta esfera.
[D]En los cielos glo[Bm]ria a D[E]ios;
[F#m]al mortal paz e[A]n la tierra,
[D]canta la ce[Bm]leste vo[E]z.
{eop}

{soc}
[D]Con los cielos[Bm] alabem[E]os
[F#m]al eterno Rey, [Bm]cantem[E]os
[D]a Jesús, que es n[Bm]uestro bien,
[E]con el[F#m] Coro d[D]e Belé[F#]n.
[F#m]Canta [D]la celest[Bm]e voz:
[E]¡En los cielos gloria a Dios!   [D]
{eoc}

{sop:Bridge 1}
[D]Canta[E] la cele[F#m]ste voz[C#m]
[D]   [E]    [F#m]   [C#m]
